<title>GREECE: MACEDONIA THRACE BANK CUTS CONSUMER LOAN RATES.</title>
<headline>MACEDONIA THRACE BANK CUTS CONSUMER LOAN RATES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macedonia-Thrace Bank </p>
<p>will cut its rates on consumer loans effective August 1, it said</p>
<p>on Tuesday.</p>
<p>** Consumer loans down 200 basis points to 17.5 percent</p>
<p>** Car loans reduced by 50 basis points to 17.5 percent</p>
<p>** Personal loans down 75 basis points to 20.5 percent</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
